<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues to expand its presence in southern Lebanon, building roads and opening bases while striking Qantara and conducting overflights that wounded a Lebanese footballer and detaining a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah has arrested five members in Batroun, kept artillery fire on Israeli positions and begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Lebanon has asked Syria to extradite suspects in the killing of former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani, while UNRWA funding cuts deepen hardship for Palestinian refugees in Lebanon. 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/11/13/unrwa-funding-cuts-deepen-hardship-for-palestinian-refugees-in-lebanon?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOSzBYVTZaWEE5UlVZVlFscjNtUkFERXhGcEtUdEdSN2V6THd6cGszaHVxNUgzT2RxcGNWU296VS16T2Q1Q0ltWUt0eDBfVTRaMW5WdWVBY0RRYnlVZFg4RnotVkFKODhOUTBMMUJSY2V3UGFibVpCci1qNk5qdHk5QTVNb0JUbHlJenI1NG9KMEpYWUNZX1gzMjY2dk8xT1NLTk82Smh1Z3lQalp6bDlpOF9UdGptU3JhUnZtSUQ3aHl1cHFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
